## Interface: 16001
## Title: Cozy Fishing
## Notes: A fishing hook on the screen while a fishing pole is in hand: left-click casts, right-click hooks the fish (or a key for each). Shows the catch of the session, the Fishing skill, a lure reminder and the history by zone.
